{"seq":1,"slug":"types-variables","title":"类型系统与变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-core-language/types-variables","wordCount":942,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型系统与变量\">类型系统与变量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>C++ 的类型系统是语言最核心的设计支柱之一，它在编译期对每个表达式和变量实施严格的类型检查，确保内存安全和语义正确性。与 JavaScript 或 Python 等动态类型语言不同，C++ 的类型在编译时完全确定，编译器根据类型信息进行内存布局、函数重载解析和隐式转换。理解 C++ 的类型系统是掌握指针、引用、模板等高级特性的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[C++ 类型系统] --&gt; B[基本类型]&#10;    A --&gt; C[复合类型]&#10;    A --&gt; D[类型限定符]&#10;    B --&gt; E[整数类型 int/long/short]&#10;    B --&gt; F[浮点类型 float/double]&#10;    B --&gt; G[字符类型 char/wchar_t]&#10;    B --&gt; H[布尔类型 bool]&#10;    B --&gt; I[void]&#10;    C --&gt; J[数组]&#10;    C --&gt; K[指针]&#10;    C --&gt; L[引用]&#10;    C --&gt; M[struct / class]&#10;    C --&gt; N[union / enum]&#10;    D --&gt; O[const]&#10;    D --&gt; P[volatile]&#10;    D --&gt; Q[mutable]\">graph TD\n    A[C++ 类型系统] --&gt; B[基本类型]\n    A --&gt; C[复合类型]\n    A --&gt; D[类型限定符]\n    B --&gt; E[整数类型 int/long/short]\n    B --&gt; F[浮点类型 float/double]\n    B --&gt; G[字符类型 char/wchar_t]\n    B --&gt; H[布尔类型 bool]\n    B --&gt; I[void]\n    C --&gt; J[数组]\n    C --&gt; K[指针]\n    C --&gt; L[引用]\n    C --&gt; M[struct / class]\n    C --&gt; N[union / enum]\n    D --&gt; O[const]\n    D --&gt; P[volatile]\n    D --&gt; Q[mutable]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>字节数（典型）</th>\n<th>值范围</th>\n<th>对齐要求</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>bool</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>true / false</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>逻辑判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>char</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>-128 ~ 127</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>字符、字节操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>-2³¹ ~ 2³¹-1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>通用整数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>long long</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>-2⁶³ ~ 2⁶³-1</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>大整数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>float</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>±3.4e38</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>单精度浮点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>double</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>±1.7e308</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>双精度浮点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>size_t</td>\n<td>4/8</td>\n<td>0 ~ 2³²/2⁶⁴-1</td>\n<td>4/8</td>\n<td>数组索引、内存大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>std::string</td>\n<td>32（典型）</td>\n<td>动态</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>字符串</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"值类别与表达式分类\">值类别与表达式分类</h2><p>C++11 引入了全新的值类别体系，将表达式分为 lvalue（左值）、prvalue（纯右值）和 xvalue（将亡值），这是理解移动语义和完美转发的基础：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;utility&gt;&#10;#include &lt;string&gt;&#10;&#10;struct Widget {&#10;    std::string name;&#10;    int value;&#10;&#10;    Widget(std::string n, int v) : name(std::move(n)), value(v) {}&#10;};&#10;&#10;void demonstrate_value_categories() {&#10;    int x = 42;              // x 是 lvalue&#10;    int* p = &amp;x;             // &amp;x 合法，x 有地址&#10;&#10;    int y = x + 1;           // x + 1 是 prvalue&#10;    // int* q = &amp;(x + 1);   // 错误：prvalue 没有地址&#10;&#10;    Widget w(&quot;test&quot;, 1);&#10;    Widget&amp;&amp; rref = std::move(w);  // std::move(w) 是 xvalue&#10;&#10;    auto&amp;&amp; universal = Widget(&quot;tmp&quot;, 2);  // 转发引用绑定到 prvalue&#10;&#10;    const int&amp; cref = 42;   // const 引用可以绑定 prvalue（生命周期延长）&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;utility></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;string></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Widget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::string name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    Widget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) : </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n)), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demonstrate_value_categories</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              // x 是 lvalue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             // &#x26;x 合法，x 有地址</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // x + 1 是 prvalue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // int* q = &#x26;(x + 1);   // 错误：prvalue 没有地址</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Widget </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Widget</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // std::move(w) 是 xvalue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> universal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Widget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tmp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 转发引用绑定到 prvalue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // const 引用可以绑定 prvalue（生命周期延长）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>值类别的实际意义在于编译器对不同类别的表达式采用不同的处理策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>值类别</th>\n<th>有身份（Identity）</th>\n<th>可移动（Movable）</th>\n<th>典型示例</th>\n<th>可取地址</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>lvalue</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>变量名、解引用</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>prvalue</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>字面量、临时对象</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xvalue</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>std::move() 结果</td>\n<td>否（语义上）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"类型推导与-auto\">类型推导与 auto</h2><p>C++11 的 auto 和 C++14 的 decltype(auto) 让编译器自动推导变量类型，减少冗余的类型声明。但 auto 的推导规则与模板参数推导一致，有一些需要注意的边界情况：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;vector&gt;&#10;#include &lt;initializer_list&gt;&#10;&#10;void demonstrate_auto_deduction() {&#10;    auto i = 42;                    // int&#10;    auto d = 3.14;                  // double&#10;    auto s = &quot;hello&quot;;              // const char*（不是 std::string）&#10;&#10;    const auto&amp; cr = i;            // const int&amp;&#10;    auto&amp;&amp; ur = i;                 // int&amp;（转发引用绑定到 lvalue）&#10;    auto&amp;&amp; ur2 = 42;              // int&amp;&amp;（转发引用绑定到 rvalue）&#10;&#10;    auto list = {1, 2, 3};        // std::initializer_list&lt;int&gt;&#10;    // auto bad = {1, 2.0};       // 错误：推导冲突&#10;&#10;    std::vector&lt;int&gt; vec = {1, 2, 3};&#10;    auto it = vec.begin();         // std::vector&lt;int&gt;::iterator&#10;    const auto cit = vec.cbegin(); // std::vector&lt;int&gt;::const_iterator&#10;&#10;    auto [a, b] = std::pair{1, &quot;hello&quot;};  // C++17 结构化绑定&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vector></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;initializer_list></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<s